docs {
  # Get Total Mitra Kerja Riset
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/capaian/stats/mitra-riset`
  
  **Auth Required:** ❌ Public
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil total mitra riset",
    "data": {
      "total": 25,
      "list": [
        { "id": "uuid", "nama": "PT Telkom Indonesia" },
        { "id": "uuid", "nama": "Bank Mandiri" }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
}
